Package: proton-drive-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VoxHash <15043788+VoxHash@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/VoxHash/proton-drive-desktop
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10),
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
         gir1.2-adw-1,
         libgtk-4-1,
         libadwaita-1-0,
         libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0,
         libsecret-1-0,
         hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: python3-gi-cairo
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Unofficial GTK4 GUI for Proton's official Drive CLI
 Proton Drive Desktop is an unofficial GTK4 / libadwaita desktop GUI for
 Proton's official proton-drive CLI. It browses My files, Photos, Shared
 with me, and Trash using the CLI session already signed in on the system.
 .
 This package installs the GUI only (Python, data, desktop entry, AppStream
 metainfo, icons, and gettext catalogs). It does not ship the proton-drive
 CLI binary. Install the official CLI separately and ensure it is on PATH
 (see https://proton.me/download/drive/cli/index.html).
 .
 Not affiliated with Proton AG.
